Implemented the auto-hiding bar in `internal/docker/appbar.go`:

- Scroll down past a small delta hides the bar (slides up); scrolling up — or returning to the top — brings it back.
- While hidden, a small "Once" tab with an `H` hint sits fixed in the top right; clicking it or pressing `H` restores the bar.
